.\" $GergiOS: bt-tool.8,v 1.0 2026/07/10 $
.\"
.Dd July 10, 2026
.Dt BT-TOOL 8
.Os GergiOS
.Sh NAME
.Nm bt-tool
.Nd Bluetooth control utility
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ic scan
.Nm
.Ic scan-stop
.Nm
.Ic devices
.Nm
.Ic connect
.Ar bdaddr
.Nm
.Ic disconnect
.Ar handle
.Nm
.Ic connections
.Nm
.Ic name
.Ar name
.Nm
.Ic discoverable
.Ar on|off
.Nm
.Ic connectable
.Ar on|off
.Nm
.Ic status
.Nm
.Ic pair
.Ar bdaddr
.Nm
.Ic unpair
.Ar bdaddr
.Nm
.Fl h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility communicates with the Bluetooth daemon
.Pq bluetoothd
to manage Bluetooth on GergiOS.
.Pp
The commands are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width "disconnect handle"
.It Ic scan
Start device discovery (inquiry scan).
.It Ic scan-stop
Stop device discovery.
.It Ic devices
List discovered remote devices.
.It Ic connect Ar bdaddr
Connect to a remote device by its Bluetooth address
(in format XX:XX:XX:XX:XX:XX).
.It Ic disconnect Ar handle
Disconnect from a remote device by its HCI connection handle.
.It Ic connections
List active Bluetooth connections.
.It Ic name Ar name
Set the local Bluetooth device name.
.It Ic discoverable Ar on|off
Enable or disable discoverability (inquiry scan).
.It Ic connectable Ar on|off
Enable or disable connectability (page scan).
.It Ic status
Show Bluetooth daemon status.
.It Ic pair Ar bdaddr
Initiate pairing with a remote device.
.It Ic unpair Ar bdaddr
Remove pairing with a remote device.
.It Fl h
Show usage information.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bluetoothd 8 ,
.Xr bluetooth 3
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
command appeared in GergiOS Phase 8.6.
